{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is near, grab, check, perform task. Otherwise, move, stop, reach destination. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = StopMoving    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsMoving    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />\"",
